  "decision_summary": "Predicted low: the query is a highly lipophilic steroidal acetal-ester prodrug (ciclesonide-like) with unfavorable solubility, and the transferable direct low-F contexts for lipophilic steroidal/ester molecules consistently support F < 20%. L3 oral-exposure records for related corticosteroid esters/acetals show very low pg/mL-level systemic exposure after mg oral doses, strengthening the low direction; confidence remains moderate because no direct query F card is available."
